      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEET IDEAL (2) is up in grade but is in fine form with three straight wins, the last two from back row draws. An ideal draw sees her as a threat. LET HER ROLL (4) had a flat tyre and a tough draw when fourth in the Vicbred Final last start. Came from one spot wider than this and worked when she took out a heat of that series prior. Has won three of five tries at this distance so could threaten. WICKED CONFESSION (7) raced parked and worked at Listed level in Sydney last start so wasn't disgraced when beaten less than 5m. She draws wide but is a capable mare who won the only time she attempted this distance.",
